<name>EFI System (2AZ-FE)</name>
<para id="X39400000RC016C" category="C" type-id="304R8" name-id="065A3-00" from="200612">
<dtccode>P0351/14</dtccode>
<dtcname>Igniter System1</dtcname>
<dtccode>P0352/15</dtccode>
<dtcname>Igniter System2</dtcname>
<dtccode>P0353/14</dtccode>
<dtcname>Igniter System3</dtcname>
<dtccode>P0354/15</dtccode>
<dtcname>Igniter System4</dtcname>
<subpara id="X39400000RC016C_10" type-id="31" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___00002UY00000">
<name>Circuit Description</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<list1 type="nonmark">
<item>
<ptxt>A direct ignition system (S-TDI) is used. S-TDI improves ignition timing accuracy, reduces high-voltage loss and improves the overall reliability of the ignition system. S-TDI performs ignition with one ignition coil for each cylinder. The engine control computer determines the ignition timing and outputs the ignition signal (IGT) to each cylinder. Based on the IGT signal, the power transistor in the igniter cuts off the current to the primary coil in the ignition coil, and the counter-electromotive force generated in the secondary coil at that time fires the spark plug. At the same time, the igniter sends an ignition confirmation signal (IGF) to the engine control computer.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="A057114J08" width="7.106578999in" height="5.787629434in"/>
</figure>
</item>
</list1>
<table frame="all" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
<tgroup cols="3" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
<colspec colnum="01" colname="C01" colwidth="0.9685897     in"/>
<colspec colnum="02" colname="C02" colwidth="3.134191     in"/>
<colspec colnum="03" colname="C03" colwidth="3.04414     in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry colname="C01" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTCNo.</ptxt>
<ptxt>SAE/TCCS</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname="C02" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC Detection Condition</ptxt>
<ptxt>1. Detection condition 2. Malfunction status 3. Malfunction duration 4. Other</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname="C03" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Inspection Area</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry colname="C01" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>P0351/14</ptxt>
<ptxt>P0352/15</ptxt>
<ptxt>P0353/14</ptxt>
<ptxt>P0354/15</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname="C02" valign="middle" align="left">
<list1 type="ordered">
<item>
<ptxt>During starting and while the engine is running (1500r/min or less)</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>IGF signal is not input 2 times or more even though IGT signal is output</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>-</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>1 trip</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
<entry colname="C03" valign="middle" align="left">
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Wire Harness or Connector</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Ignition coil assembly</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Engine Control Computer</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="X39400000RC016C_11" type-id="32" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___00002UZ00000">
<name>Wiring Diagram</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="A160923J01" width="7.106578999in" height="6.791605969in"/>
