</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="X39400000RC016C_12" type-id="51" category="05" proc-id="RM0550J___00002V000000">
<name>Inspection Procedure</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<atten4>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>If DTC P0351/14 is displayed, inspect the ignition coil assembly (cylinder No.1) circuit.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>If DTC P0352/15 is displayed, inspect the ignition coil assembly (cylinder No.2) circuit.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>If DTC P0353/14 is displayed, inspect the ignition coil assembly (cylinder No.3) circuit.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>If DTC P0354/15 is displayed, inspect the ignition coil assembly (cylinder No.4) circuit.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Using SST (TaSCAN), read the freeze frame data. The freeze frame data records part of the engine operating condition when the malfunction occurred, and this information is useful when troubleshooting.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>The following shows the inspection procedure for cylinder No.1. If a malfunction occurs in a cylinder other than cylinder No.1, refer to the following procedure and inspect the circuit of the relevant cylinder.</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</atten4>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="X39400000RC016C_13" type-id="01" category="01">
<name>Procedure</name>
<testgrp id="X39400000RC016C_13_0001" proc-id="RM0550J___00002V100000">
<testtitle>Inspect Wire Harness or Connector (Power Source Circuit)</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Disconnect the ignition coil assembly connector.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="A054393J12" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), inspect the voltage between the ignition coil assembly vehicle side connector terminals.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Voltage</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt/>
</specitem>
<table frame="all" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
<tgroup cols="3" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
<colspec colnum="1" colname="C01" colwidth="1.38in"/>
<colspec colnum="2" colname="COLSPEC0" colwidth="1.38in"/>
<colspec colnum="3" colname="C02" colwidth="1.37in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry colname="C01" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Tester Connection (Terminal Name)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname="C02" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry colname="C01" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>1(+B) - 4(GND)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>IG ON</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname="C02" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>11 to 14V</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="X39400000RC016C_13_0002" fin="false">OK</down>
<right ref="X39400000RC016C_13_0006" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
