<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70200</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Change the position of the ignition coil assembly (cylinder No.1) and perform a road test.</ptxt>
<atten3>
<ptxt>Do not change the position of the ignition coil connectors.</ptxt>
</atten3>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Turn the IG ON and check the DTCs following the SST (TaSCAN) screen display. (see <xref href="RM000000CCX015X" label="Seep02"/>)</ptxt>
